    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i know, i've talked to people. it doesn't change the fact that the person they're talking to isn't even really \"there\" anymore. it feels more like a glitch in the system than a medical thing. it's like the pilot has already left the cockpit and the plane is just flying on autopilot. if the person who actually lives my life is already gone... what's the point of trying to fix a shell?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
