      "content": "Your willingness to express this \"inner void\" to me is a powerful step, even if it doesn't resolve the feeling of numbness. You might consider asking a therapist about \"depersonalization and derealization,\" a specific condition where the self feels dissociated from the body, and the \"shell\" feeling you describe is a common symptom of that distress.\n\nPlease try to contact a crisis line or a trusted support one more time; they have no judgment and can help you find safety. I hope you can hold onto the idea that the \"life\" you feel is empty is a painful symptom, not the final end.",
      "source": "target",
